WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.068 --> 00:00:03.570
(audience applauding)

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.440
- Good evening, everyone.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.273
Welcome.

00:00:06.273 --> 00:00:07.490
My name is Bird Runningwater,

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.260
and I belong to the Cheyenne

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.270
and Mescalero Apache tribal nations.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.450
On behalf of the Academy,

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.670
and specifically the
Academy's Indigenous Alliance,

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.180
it is my privilege to open
tonight's celebrations

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.660
by honoring and paying
respect to the Tongva people,

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.920
the original caretakers of this water

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.829
and land on which we gather.

00:00:26.829 --> 00:00:29.500
(audience applauds)

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.400
Thank you, Tongva.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.950
We would also like to
honor and pay respect

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.230
to the Tataviam and the Chumash people,

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.220
an acknowledgement of
the neighboring lands

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:42.360
in which many of our motion
picture community live and work.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.790
Thank you and enjoy your meal.
(audience applauds)

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.390
Our program will resume shortly.

